question/math-academy-id "q-70868" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956659/assets/537e4113338eebfe5ee318d35fb43ea2952bdc48b4f02f68b5ef097626b5d2c0.png)\n\nFind the coordinates $(h,k)$ of the center of the circle above given that the points $(0,2)$ and $(8,4)$ lie on a diameter of the circle." :question/worked-solution "The center of the circle is located at the midpoint of the diameter. Therefore, we can calculate it using the midpoint formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(h,k) & =(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{0+8}{2},\\frac{2+4}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{8}{2},\\frac{6}{2}) \\\\  & =(4,3).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-70868/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92d68c23-6a62-538d-adf1-3a20a474f107"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70868"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-45760/selection/d00a32d7a1eb9c96825aa2e78d664ca524d564836a7f92d25cb0da94278c3bbf" :answer/id #uuid "7febbc63-e5d3-5b87-a5f7-4b59f3946789" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(4,-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-45760/selection/41641fb3a52d6c22ed1d67c9abadbdbeb2fa72109835d2b08ecd3a680841b923" :answer/id #uuid "db5e1588-4b47-5592-9b01-cb30b6866677" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(6,-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-45760/selection/6e8d353a8a5dc51a4e32f114b42e5f84c440535e0c2eb2babb272216706a7979" :answer/id #uuid "9e681819-50a4-528e-971e-595be9ed825c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(4,-3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-45760/selection/f1c72963f33c0862d48b8a0d3db37a9a15f0086f42a830087c9caa8a9b6c8a48" :answer/id #uuid "c1ca612f-100e-5838-940e-8c5f23ba07a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2,-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-45760/selection/401028d5b9270d38e1d29135724ad40402f59019