dinates $(-6,-4)$ and $(6,1)$, respectively, and the segment $\\overset{―}{AB}$ is a diameter of a circle. Determine the radius $r$ of the circle.\n\n$r=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The diameter can be calculated using the distance formula: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =\\sqrt{{({x}_{1}-{x}_{2})}^{2}+{({y}_{1}-{y}_{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-6-6)^{2}+(-4-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-12)^{2}+(-5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{144+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{169} \\\\  & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe radius is half the diameter:\n\n$$\nr=\\frac{d}{2}=\\frac{13}{2}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-263123/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8e9df1ae-8176-555b-987d-94773c27d435"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-263123"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-263144/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "49105755-7973-5680-931d-5f7905d988c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263144/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "a1143a57-d9ca-552f-83b6-95f84afd424c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263144/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "c1169bc1-ab00-54fe-a446-da8d032fa47e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263144/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer-field/choices ["q-263144/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-263144/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263144/field-2/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "169f1da7-4d29-5d14-a805-70664f1a35c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263144/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "1761446f-0215-54a0-883e-15b49b3acb33" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263144/field-2/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer-field/choices ["q-263144/field-2/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263144/field-3/5b623f0f6ae88ff9928250ba147bc9b4254d8f2e3c315ccb8a7aa3f6251fc491" :answer/id #uuid "9510928c-2dfd-542c-9fb1-2a1aec511d76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\sqrt{13}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263144/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "63a94b8e-4d5b-595a-b7f1-ef92ba3462e7" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263144/field-3/5b623f0f6ae88ff9928250ba147bc9b4254d8f2e3c315ccb8a7aa3f6251fc491" :answer-field/choices ["q-263144/field-3/5b623f0f6ae88ff9928250ba147bc9b4254d8f2e3c315ccb8a7aa3f6251fc491"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263144" :question/id #uuid "c222bb01-f724-5bcc-bdd1-eb24868f74e2" :question/math-academy-id "q-263144" :question/problem "The segment $\\overset{―}{AB}$ is the diameter of a circle where the points $A$ and $B$ have coordinates $(-7,2)$ and $(5,-6)$, respectively. Find the coordinates of the center and the radius of the circle.\n\nThe circle is centered at  $(${{field-1}}$,${{field-2}}$)$ and its radius is{{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "The center of the circle is located at the midpoint of the diameter. So, we can calculate the coordinates of the center using the midpoint formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(h,k) & =(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{-7+5}{2},\\frac{2+(-6)}{2}) \\\\  & =(-\\frac{2}{2},-\\frac{4}{2}) \\\\  & =(-1,-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe radius can be found by calculating the distance between the center $(-1,-2)$ and a point on the circle, such as $(5,-6):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =\\sqrt{{({x}_{1}-{x}_{2})}^{2}+{({y}_{1}-{y}_{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(-1-5)}^{2}+{(-2-(-6))}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-6)^{2}+{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{36+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{52} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{13}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the circle is centered at $(-1,-2),$ and its radius is $2\\sqrt{13}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-263144/field-1" "q-263144/field-2" "q-263144/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "52384502-66c5-5089-b38f-d46b94877430"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-263144"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-263167/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "5f3c5222-f7e1-5752-b1b9-50fef71b99ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263167/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "6bea43a8-4548-5066-afb1-a18f7f399941" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263167/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-263167/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263167/field-2/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "8caaff0e-df74-5887-b57c-3eb9c644b3fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263167/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "77efc2e1-01eb-5e87-a83f-10ea38b6c15f" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263167/field-2/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer-field/choices ["q-263167/field-2/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263167/field-3/4742791b29e13d1aa8c78af34b323ff828bbc6793778cffe13f5de5a2841a825" :answer/id #uuid "f14e926b-294e-50d1-9779-3811b118f577" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{65}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263167/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "a67ebbcb-9624-5567-9c60-cbc0af1a8fe7" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263167/field-3/4742791b29e13d1aa8c78af34b323ff828bbc6793778cffe13f5de5a2841a825" :answer-field/choices ["q-263167/field-3/4742791b29e13d1aa8c78af34b323ff828bbc6793778cffe13f5de5a2841a825"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263167" :question/id #uuid "c62059c9-8c0c-5ac1-b93b-8b77b705e04c" :question/math-academy-id "q-263167" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956659/assets/4fe49781cc2874d12d3c53da4785cb6173887f4d39433b0e456efd9208781724.png)\n\nGiven that the points $(10,6)$ and $(-6,8)$ lie on a diameter of a circle, what are the center and radius of the circle?\n\nThe circle is centered at  $(${{field-1}}$,${{field-2}}$)$ and its radius is{{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "The center of the circle is located at the midpoint of the diameter. So, we can calculate the coordinates of the center using the midpoint formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(h,k) & =(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{10+(-6)}{2},\\frac{6+8}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{4}{2},\\frac{14}{2}) \\\\  & =(2,7)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe radius can be found by calculating the distance between the center $(2,7)$ and a point on the circle, such as $(10,6):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =\\sqrt{{({x}_{1}-{x}_{2})}^{2}+{({y}_{1}-{y}_{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(2-10)}^{2}+{(7-6)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-8)^{2}+(1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{64+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{65}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the circle is centered at $(2,7),$ and its radius is $\\sqrt{65}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-263167/field-1" "q-263167/field-2" "q-263167/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "52384502-66c5-5089-b38f-d46b94877430"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-263167"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115364/selection/820974c59806794e83f28d53072c0693c6465b277b2b2d3ff2185a3b40ccb4c3" :answer/id #uuid "20fdaec5-9333-5757-9e87-c84ae49ecb37" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(0,3)$ and the radius is $1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115364/selection/18916eef2b50adb127ef32f85f7a0f61094cb9d534a34fe1b392b9cfb663b7fa" :answer/id #uuid "d7ff976b-cb6a-5fd7-9627-4fbed1c64a56" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(0,3)$ and the radius is $2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115364/selection/9e321fb8df7b3d7b5a2e6e77a54b3c03c8242f48fd5f9843c5ac6549d81be25e" :answer/id #uuid "14441f1d-03e5-5b3a-b7c1-9daf4540e8d1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(0,3)$ and the radius is $\\sqrt{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115364/selection/1f09d62c1ef167549e34c25039ee473a37b01627ac55dcc57f3fe2e4a2d494bb" :answer/id #uuid "0b992e18-356c-5845-aa6b-2e100e2ef380" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(0,4)$ and the radius is $1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115364/selection/6e8b450743f4547cc7e473fe8cb1077849a55d58e2d87ba449f5c4130f1f6572" :answer/id #uuid "93793513-b2d5-59e6-aa3d-17479745b092" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(0,4)$ and the radius is $2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115364/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4cf9a08a-c5ba-5948-a222-2d7b38169f05" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-115364/selection/9e321fb8df7b3d7b5a2e6e77a54b3c03c8242f48fd5f9843c5ac6549d81be25e" :answer-field/choices ["q-115364/selection/820974c59806794e83f28d53072c0693c6465b277b2b2d3ff2185a3b40ccb4c3" "q-115364/selection/18916eef2b50adb127ef32f85f7a0f61094cb9d534a34fe1b392b9cfb663b7fa" "q-115364/selection/9e321fb8df7b3d7b5a2e6e77a54b3c03c8242f48fd5f9843c5ac6549d81be25e" "q-115364/selection/1f09d62c1ef167549e34c25039ee473a37b01627ac55dcc57f3fe2e4a2d494bb" "q-115364/selection/6e8b450743f4547cc7e473fe8cb1077849a55d58e2d87ba449f5c4130f1f6572"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-115364" :question/id #uuid "a02e3599-0d24-591c-985f-c45e9f652ee9" :question/math-academy-id "q-115364" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956659/assets/3af3101fd7a103e8382755177ca1ebab9bc1cdf48aebd34af8ac7cc92991387c.png)\n\nGiven that the points $(-1,2)$ and $(1,4)$ lie on a diameter of a circle, what are the center and radius of the circle?" :question/worked-solution "The center of the circle is located at the midpoint of the diameter. So, we can calculate the coordinates of the center using the midpoint formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(h,k) & =(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{-1+1}{2},\\frac{2+4}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{0}{2},\\frac{6}{2}) \\\\  & =(0,3)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe radius can be found by calculating the distance between the center $(0,3)$ and a point on the circle, such as $(-1,2):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =\\sqrt{{({x}_{1}-{x}_{2})}^{2}+{({y}_{1}-{y}_{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(-1-0)}^{2}+{(2-3)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-115364/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "52384502-66c5-5089-b38f-d46b94877430"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115364"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-54052/selection/c0b73ac0c8dbf771b5f73248da48f3380b3e4f68ebc95d96b09cc8bffbfdf524" :answer/id #uuid "70c6ffab-f545-56db-b6a5-e8ce1293b342" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(0,2b)$ and the radius is $5b$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-54052/selection/ba7ea75f25ecaff19639859356580dc61aa7d5dfe14129f090bc420c7c028670" :answer/id #uuid "9a9225ba-b540-5fd4-a46f-aabc47564bc9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(b,2b)$ and the radius is $4b$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-54052/selection/cfa4cabd84debc84e99eccf03d4ad7e2cebd126c2d3a5c051e8b3f8d3da826e5" :answer/id #uuid "bdb6cdc8-cb29-5dfe-866e-ed6770490d45" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(0,b)$ and the radius is $3b$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-54052/selection/eae7f0ebcdd7bca883547d1de086284707471c85c099d06e46bf68e58de5eb7b" :answer/id #uuid "03ed36a9-8ced-52d7-9635-dfd92ba6643f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(b,b)$ and the radius is $5|b|$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-54052/selection/a61528a37ad8ea3de5cabf7c3a8c1c7f3576c123ace99e7c962a1447d2a26840" :answer/id #uuid "34ce10c5-83f7-5561-819c-a7999739cc4c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The center is $(b,3b)$ and the radius is $3|b|$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-54052/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2c541cd1-b41b-5265-bd1f-577fa0198aeb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-54052/selection/c0b73ac0c8dbf771b5f73248da48f3380b3e4f68ebc95d96b09cc8bffbfdf524" :answer-field/choices ["q-54052/selection/c0b73ac0c8dbf771b5f73248da48f3380b3e4f68ebc95d96b09cc8bffbfdf524" "q-54052/selection/ba7ea75f25ecaff19639859356580dc61aa7d5dfe14129f090bc420c7c028670" "q-54052/selection/cfa4cabd84debc84e99eccf03d4ad7e2cebd126c2d3a5c051e8b3f8d3da826e5" "q-54052/selection/eae7f0ebcdd7bca883547d1de086284707471c85c099d06e46bf68e58de5eb7b" "q-54052/selection/a61528a37ad8ea3de5cabf7c3a8c1c7f3576c123ace99e7c962a1447d2a26840"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-54052" :question/id #uuid "1ed57943-8c13-5d28-8950-36097beaedf0" :question/math-academy-id "q-54052" :question/problem "The segment $\\overset{―}{AB}$ is the diameter of a circle where the points $A$ and $B$ have coordinates $(3b,6b)$ and $(-3b,-2b)$, respectively, with $b>0.$ Find the coordinates of the center and the radius of the circle." :question/worked-solution "The center of the circle is located at the midpoint of the diameter. So, we can calculate the coordinates of the center using the midpoint formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(h,k) & =(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{3b+(-3b)}{2},\\frac{6b+(-2b)}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{0}{2},\\frac{4b}{2}) \\\\  & =(0,2b).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe radius can be found by calculating the distance between the center $(0,2b)$ and a point on the circle, such as $A(3b,6b):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =\\sqrt{{({x}_{1}-{x}_{2})}^{2}+{({y}_{1}-{y}_{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(0-3b)^{2}+(2b-6b)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3b)^{2}+(-4b)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9{b}^{2}+16{b}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25{b}^{2}} \\\\  & =5|b|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $b>0,$ we have that \n\n$$\nr=5|b|=5b.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the center of the circle is at $(0,2b)$ and the radius is $5b.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-54052/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "52384502-66c5-5089-b38f-d46b94877430"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-54052"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-263155/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "69f421ec-92cb-53d4-b70e-b920d4c593c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263155/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a9d85eaa-a178-5828-821a-40be70e773ba" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263155/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-263155/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263155/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "51c2bb1f-96d2-5909-8249-267b3577d352" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263155/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "0855d6f4-4b04-536d-b3df-e1d329d80fc3" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263155/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-263155/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263155/field-3/94ee027a688ca91424939a0f105bbb941a9fc5dced1e94113427147a36e2ec8f" :answer/id #uuid "94cbaf7e-ce1e-5614-8ee8-2b2ed906d005" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{17}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263155/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "d33ed024-a643-542a-a041-8b9d487f51f7" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263155/field-3/94ee027a688ca91424939a0f105bbb941a9fc5dced1e94113427147a36e2ec8f" :answer-field/choices ["q-263155/field-3/94ee027a688ca91424939a0f105bbb941a9fc5dced1e94113427147a36e2ec8f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263155" :question/id #uuid "606e5137-bc60-51a7-b5d5-2fd0110d4c66" :question/math-academy-id "q-263155" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956659/assets/752774e8849a8dfbb2badb1124b4be72f585751d7051eddb57d64c471990ec08.png)\n\nGiven that the points $(4,5)$ and $(2,-3)$ lie on a diameter of a circle, what are the center and radius of the circle?\n\nThe circle is centered at  $(${{field-1}}$,${{field-2}}$)$ and its radius is{{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "The center of the circle is located at the midpoint of the diameter. So, we can calculate the coordinates of the center using the midpoint formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(h,k) & =(\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2},\\frac{{y}_{1}+{y}_{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{4+2}{2},\\frac{5+(-3)}{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{6}{2},\\frac{2}{2}) \\\\  & =(3,1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe radius can be found by calculating the distance between the center $(3,1)$ and a point on the circle, such as $(4,5):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =\\sqrt{{({x}_{1}-{x}_{2})}^{2}+{({y}_{1}-{y}_{2})}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(3-4)}^{2}+{(1-5)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+(-4)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{17}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the circle is centered at $(3,1),$ and its radius is $\\sqrt{17}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-263155/field-1" "q-263155/field-2" "q-263155/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "52384502-66c5-5089-b38f-d46b94877430"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-263155"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
